        },
        {
            "over": "5",
            "ball": "5",
            "runs": 0,
            "type": "ball",
            "text": "Anshul Kamboj to Nicholls, <b>FOUR</b>, nicely controlled open-face defence. Full outside off, Henry Nicholls gets forward and deliberately opens the face of the bat as he guides it to the left of gully. Went down and to the vacant third man fence",
            "batsman": "",
            "bowler": ""
        },
        {
            "over": "5",
            "ball": "4",
            "runs": 0,
            "type": "ball",
            "text": "Anshul Kamboj to Nicholls, leg byes, <b>FOUR</b>, poor line and that runs away off the pad. Length delivery and sliding down leg, Henry Nicholls flicks and misses. Goes away off the thigh pad to the fine-leg fence",
            "batsman": "",
            "bowler": ""
        },
        {
            "over": "5",
            "ball": "3",
            "runs": 0,
            "type": "ball",
            "text": "Anshul Kamboj to Nicholls, no run, wide of the crease and short of length outside off, rising, moving away, Henry Nicholls lets it go",
            "batsman": "",
            "bowler": ""
        },
        {
            "over": "5",
            "ball": "2",
            "runs": 0,
            "type": "ball",
            "text": "Anshul Kamboj to Nicholls, no run, well outside off, full, a breather for Henry Nicholls as he lets it go",
            "batsman": "",
            "bowler": ""
        },
        {
            "over": "5",
            "ball": "1",
            "runs": 0,
            "type": "ball",
            "text": "Anshul Kamboj to Nicholls, no run, <b>thick outside edge and doesn't carry to third slip.</b> Anshul Kamboj angles this good length delivery on middle, squares Henry Nicholls up on the back foot, luckily for him the outside edge doesn't carry. Movement away forced the edge",
            "batsman": "",
            "bowler": ""
        },
        {
            "over": "4",
            "ball": "6",
            "runs": 0,
            "type": "ball",
            "text": "Jasprit Bumrah to Rachin Ravindra, no run, full and angled in on off, a solid forward defence back",
            "batsman": "",
            "bowler": ""
        },
        {
            "over": "4",
            "ball": "5",
            "runs": 0,
            "type": "ball",
            "text": "Jasprit Bumrah to Rachin Ravindra, no run, full and further wide of off, moves away, left alone",
            "batsman": "",
            "bowler": ""
        },
        {
            "over": "4",
            "ball": "4",
            "runs": 0,
            "type": "ball",
            "text": "Jasprit Bumrah to Rachin Ravindra, no run, <b>beaten again.</b> Similar delivery to the last one, just that this angles in and then seams away. Rachin Ravindra is covering for the inward movement, so plays at that and the movement beats the outside edge",
            "batsman": "",
            "bowler": ""
        },
        {
            "over": "4",
            "ball": "3",
            "runs": 0,
            "type": "ball",
            "text": "Jasprit Bumrah to Rachin Ravindra, no run, <b>beaten!</b> Jasprit Bumrah goes wide of the crease and angles this on the 5th-stump line, full and holds its line, Rachin Ravindra is beaten on the forward defence. Gill with a smile on his face as he claps in encouragement",
            "batsman": "",
            "bowler": ""
        },
        {
            "over": "4",
            "ball": "2",
            "runs": 0,
            "type": "ball",
            "text": "Jasprit Bumrah to Rachin Ravindra, no run, full and in the 5th-stump line, holds its line, Rachin Ravindra is sucked into the forward defence and is beaten. Could've and should've left that alone",
            "batsman": "",
            "bowler": ""
        }
    ],
